<title>FRANCE: Alcatel Alsthom sales breakdown.</title>
<headline>Alcatel Alsthom sales breakdown.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>(All figures in millions of French francs)</p>
<p>    Turnover 161,979    vs  160,416</p>
<p>    - telecom				     71,152    vs   66,926</p>
<p>    - cables					36,409    vs   40,696</p>
<p>    - GEC Alsthom (50 pct)	 29,917    vs   29,384</p>
<p>    - Systems				     23,651    vs   21,163</p>
<p>    - batteries				    5,025    vs    4,440</p>
<p>NOTE - Alcatel gave the figures in a statement. The figures may not add up to the total due to intra-group sales.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
</text>
